#### Phase 2.2: Frontend Security Improvements (PARALLEL)
**Status**: Ready to implement

**Tasks**:
1. ✅ DOMPurify integration (sanitizer.ts created)
2. ✅ ErrorBoundary component (created)
3. ✅ ApiError class (created)
4. ✅ useAsyncOperation hook (created)
5. ⏳ Apply to all components
6. ⏳ Sentry monitoring setup
7. ⏳ Unit tests (critical paths)
8. ⏳ 2FA implementation (TOTP)

**Security Improvements**:
```
Before (Risk: MEDIUM-HIGH)          After (Risk: LOW)
├─ XSS (dangerouslySetInnerHTML)   ├─ Sanitized HTML
├─ No error boundary                ├─ ErrorBoundary
├─ Inconsistent errors              ├─ Unified ApiError
├─ No async management              ├─ useAsyncOperation
├─ Sentry: None                     ├─ Sentry: Active
└─ 2FA: Not implemented             └─ 2FA: TOTP enabled
```

**Time Estimate**: 6 hours

---

