## 🚀 COMMANDS QUICK REFERENCE

### Backend
```bash
# Setup
cd D:\Decarbonize\backend
npm install
npm run migrate

# Development
npm run dev

# Build
npm run build

# Testing
npm run test
```

### Frontend
```bash
# Setup
cd D:\Decarbonize
npm install

# Development
npm run dev

# Build
npm run build

# Testing
npm run test
```

### Database
```bash
# Connect
mysql -u decarbonize -p decarbonize_dev

# Show tables
SHOW TABLES;

# Create user (if needed)
CREATE USER 'decarbonize'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'Dev123!@#';
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON decarbonize_dev.* TO 'decarbonize'@'localhost';
```

